  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Component Types**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the data structures necessary for my React components. I\'ve started by outlining the essential types, like navigation items, booking states, perspective tabs, attendance student items, invoice items, and the parent data structure. This foundational work will help ensure a clean and modular React component structure.\n\n\n**Expanding Component Library**\n\nI\'m now expanding the component library, incorporating elements like portal items, pricing tiers, and testimonials. I\'ve also started outlining specific components. For example, `Navbar.tsx` will include a sticky header with a blur effect, a logo, navigation links, and a mobile menu. The `HeroSection.tsx` will focus on the main selling points with a category badge, heading, subheading, inline checkmark list and CTA buttons.\n\n\n\n**Developing Feature Displays**\n\nI\'m currently working on the `Section.tsx` component, focusing on a 3-column, 2-row grid featuring hoverable cards that highlight core functionality. I\'m also delving into the `InteractiveShowcase.tsx` component, which will feature a tabbed interface. I\'m especially focused on the dynamic, reactive layout, where tab selections trigger different interactive content. The showcase will have a weekly attendance grid, and an invoice/pay desk mockup.\n\n\n**Detailing Interactive Showcase**\n\nI\'m now detailing Tab 3 within `InteractiveShowcase.tsx`. It features a \"Transparent Family Portal\" with key benefits and an interactive parent portal mockup. This includes invoice handling: pending/overdue invoices, \"Send WhatsApp Link,\" and \"Mark Paid\" buttons with live balance recalculation.\n\nI\'m also working on `src/components/MetricsSection.tsx`, which will highlight \"EARLY RESULTS\" with a grid of three pilot testimonial cards and supporting quantitative badges. Lastly, I\'m defining the `PricingSection.tsx`, focusing on three pricing tiers, including a featured standard tier.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 970430368
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
