  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the full-page landing page for **Silsila Maktab** based on your high-fidelity design specification.\n\n### Key Implementation Highlights\n\n- **Design System & Global Tokens**:\n  - Configured exact brand tokens: `--primary` (`#1D564B` Deep Forest Green), `--accent` (`#00A896` Bright Mint), `--background` (`#FBF9F6` Warm Off-White), `--card` (`#FFFFFF`), `--secondary` (`#EEEAE5`), `--border` (`#E1DCD6`), and `--destructive` (`#D9383A`).\n  - Standardized the typography using **Plus Jakarta Sans** with clean proportional scaling and strict spacing rules (`--space-section`, `--space-block`, `--space-element`).\n\n- **Interactive Core Sections**:\n  1. **Sticky Header**: Silsila by Sylergy branding, navigation anchors, quick portal links, and the primary mint demo booking action.\n  2. **Hero Fold & Live Mockup**: Value proposition, checkmark benefits, and an interactive **Administrator Dashboard** preview with live attendance tracking, fee collection progress bar, and overdue invoice alerts.\n  3. **Social Proof Band**: Prominent blockquotes from Ustadh Bilal Vance (Head Teacher, Madrasah Al-Ansar) and Fihan Rahman (Treasurer).\n  4. **From Chaos to Calm**: High-contrast deep teal comparison highlighting fragmented spreadsheets vs. Silsila\'s unified web workflows.\n  5. **Feature Toolkit Grid**: 6 hoverable feature cards covering rapid attendance registers, core pupil stats, automated invoices, WhatsApp & SMS links, parent portal, and audit logs.\n  6. **Interactive Showcase (\"See it in action\")**: Reactive 3-perspective switcher (**Staff Attendance Register**, **Admin Fee Pay Desk**, and **Parent Portal**) with real-time clickable attendance toggles (P/L/A) and payment actions.\n  7. **Early Results & Metrics**: Quantitative metrics strip and 3 pilot feedback cards illustrating the 70% reduction in fee-chasing time.\n  8. **Transparent Pricing**: Three structured tiers (Starter \302\24329, Standard \302\24349 featured with mint accent border, Pro \302\24399) with interactive billing frequency toggles.\n  9. **\"A Chain Unbroken\" Mission**: 3-column values block highlighting tradition, low-connectivity optimization, and migration support.\n  10. **Final CTA Banner & Footer**: High-impact deep forest green banner with radial grid texture, demo triggers, and clean footer credits.\n  11. **Interactive Demo & Portal Modals**: Form to book a 15-minute walkthrough and passwordless parent magic link preview."
    thinking: "**Verifying Adherence to Specs**\n\nI\'m meticulously reviewing the provided prompt and specification. Currently, my focus is on ensuring absolute adherence to the user\'s requirements. I\'m cross-referencing all details, including brand identity and global style tokens, to guarantee complete accuracy. Specifically, I\'m verifying the name and exact custom properties, like `--primary: #1D564B`, as provided. I am trying to make certain everything is accounted for.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built the full-page landing page for **Silsila Maktab** based on your high-fidelity design specification.\n\n### Key Implementation Highlights\n\n- **Design System & Global Tokens**:\n  - Configured exact brand tokens: `--primary` (`#1D564B` Deep Forest Green), `--accent` (`#00A896` Bright Mint), `--background` (`#FBF9F6` Warm Off-White), `--card` (`#FFFFFF`), `--secondary` (`#EEEAE5`), `--border` (`#E1DCD6`), and `--destructive` (`#D9383A`).\n  - Standardized the typography using **Plus Jakarta Sans** with clean proportional scaling and strict spacing rules (`--space-section`, `--space-block`, `--space-element`).\n\n- **Interactive Core Sections**:\n  1. **Sticky Header**: Silsila by Sylergy branding, navigation anchors, quick portal links, and the primary mint demo booking action.\n  2. **Hero Fold & Live Mockup**: Value proposition, checkmark benefits, and an interactive **Administrator Dashboard** preview with live attendance tracking, fee collection progress bar, and overdue invoice alerts.\n  3. **Social Proof Band**: Prominent blockquotes from Ustadh Bilal Vance (Head Teacher, Madrasah Al-Ansar) and Fihan Rahman (Treasurer).\n  4. **From Chaos to Calm**: High-contrast deep teal comparison highlighting fragmented spreadsheets vs. Silsila\'s unified web workflows.\n  5. **Feature Toolkit Grid**: 6 hoverable feature cards covering rapid attendance registers, core pupil stats, automated invoices, WhatsApp & SMS links, parent portal, and audit logs.\n  6. **Interactive Showcase (\"See it in action\")**: Reactive 3-perspective switcher (**Staff Attendance Register**, **Admin Fee Pay Desk**, and **Parent Portal**) with real-time clickable attendance toggles (P/L/A) and payment actions.\n  7. **Early Results & Metrics**: Quantitative metrics strip and 3 pilot feedback cards illustrating the 70% reduction in fee-chasing time.\n  8. **Transparent Pricing**: Three structured tiers (Starter \302\24329, Standard \302\24349 featured with mint accent border, Pro \302\24399) with interactive billing frequency toggles.\n  9. **\"A Chain Unbroken\" Mission**: 3-column values block highlighting tradition, low-connectivity optimization, and migration support.\n  10. **Final CTA Banner & Footer**: High-impact deep forest green banner with radial grid texture, demo triggers, and clean footer credits.\n  11. **Interactive Demo & Portal Modals**: Form to book a 15-minute walkthrough and passwordless parent magic link preview."
